// 3 days/week, ~30 min sessions, moderate intensity. Equipment: Resistance bands, Pull-up bar.
# Week 1
// Estimated ~28 min
## Full Body A
// Arms forward for balance, full depth you can control.
Squat, Bodyweight / 3x8 / 0kg / 75s / warmup: none / progress: custom(maxReps: 15) {~
  if (completedReps >= reps && reps[ns] < state.maxReps) {
    reps += 1
  }
~}
